# Non-secret Renovate runtime config, loaded via envFrom (configMapRef: renovate).
# Flux postBuild.substitute reaches ConfigMap data, so ${LOG_LEVEL} resolves at
# reconcile time (the optional LOG_LEVEL install param). The two path values are
# static literals that pair the container with its volume mounts.
LOG_LEVEL=${LOG_LEVEL}
RENOVATE_CONFIG_FILE=/opt/renovate/config.json
RENOVATE_BASE_DIR=/tmp/renovate
